@startuml uc02-analysis-sequence
' Figure 5.2.2: analysis sequence diagram for UC-02 Organize Assignments.
' Message numbers match the scenario table in docs/p2/sections/5-2-uc02.md, one message per row.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng docs/p2/diagrams/uc02-analysis-sequence.puml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor Student
boundary AssistantInterface
control AssignmentOrganizer
entity ":Student" as StudentRecord
entity ":Course" as Course
entity ":Assignment" as Assignment
entity ":Submission" as Submission

Student -> AssistantInterface : 1 asks for an organized list of\nassignments from their enrolled courses
AssistantInterface -> AssignmentOrganizer : 2.1 passes on the request to\norganize the student's assignments
AssignmentOrganizer -> StudentRecord : 2.2 asks for the courses the\nstudent is enrolled in

loop each enrolled course
  AssignmentOrganizer -> Course : 2.3 asks the course for its\npublished assignments
  break A3: the course's assignments cannot be retrieved
    Course --> AssignmentOrganizer : A3.1 reports that its assignments\ncannot be retrieved
    AssignmentOrganizer -> AssistantInterface : A3.2 reports that the assignment\nlist could not be completed
    AssistantInterface -> Student : A3.3 explains that assignment\ninformation is temporarily\nunavailable, without a partial list
  end
  loop each assignment of the course
    AssignmentOrganizer -> Assignment : 2.4 asks the assignment for the\nstudent's submission status
    Assignment -> Submission : 2.5 looks up the\nstudent's submission
  end
end

AssignmentOrganizer -> AssignmentOrganizer : 2.6 orders the assignments by due date,\nplacing undated ones last and marking\nthem as having no deadline
AssignmentOrganizer -> AssistantInterface : 2.7 hands over the organized list
AssistantInterface -> Student : 2.8 shows the organized list

Student -> AssistantInterface : 3 asks for more information\nabout one assignment
AssistantInterface -> AssignmentOrganizer : 4.1 passes on the request for\nthat assignment's details
AssignmentOrganizer -> Assignment : 4.2 asks the assignment for its instructions,\ndue date and the student's submission status
Assignment -> Submission : 4.3 looks up the\nstudent's submission
AssignmentOrganizer -> AssistantInterface : 4.4 hands over the assignment's details
AssistantInterface -> Student : 4.5 shows the assignment's details\nand confirms they have been provided
@enduml
